@host = http://localhost:5210

### Which store is answering right now
GET {{host}}/api/system/status

### The board
GET {{host}}/api/repair-jobs

### The workflow: statuses and the legal moves between them
GET {{host}}/api/statuses

### Audit trail for one repair order (replace the id from the list above)
GET {{host}}/api/repair-jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/history

### A legal move
PUT {{host}}/api/repair-jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "InProgress" }

### An illegal move - expect 422 with an allowedTransitions array
PUT {{host}}/api/repair-jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Completed" }
